sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Link, contract, validate, and meld
    accDescr: Provider and consumer subsystems conjure separate conduits. The provider links to the consumer, the consumer pulls selected spell permissions into its contract, validates, and then resolves its root using the provider.

    actor App as Application
    participant Provider as Platform conduit
    participant Consumer as Services conduit
    participant Runtime as Meld

    App->>Provider: conjure(dynamic=True)
    App->>Consumer: conjure()
    App->>Provider: link(Consumer) through transaction plane
    Provider->>Consumer: establish link contract
    App->>Consumer: pull provider spell + permission
    Consumer->>Provider: record contracted visibility
    App->>Consumer: validate contracts
    App->>Consumer: meld(Service)
    Consumer->>Runtime: resolve local root + contracted provider
    Runtime-->>App: composed Service instance
